243	     * when 18 to 64, and {@code 'SENIOR'} when 65 or older. The age is the number of whole years
244	     * elapsed from the birth date to the registration date (defaulting to the server's current date
245	     * when no registration date is set yet). Returns {@code null} when no birth date was supplied.
